        "data": {
            "type": "game",
            "name": "Kingdom Tales 2: Viking Saga",
            "steam_appid": 288610,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/288610/extras/e8a7a2b7ccd3349d97717cb15fa46196.avif?t=1765537731\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fun and colorful city builder - time management strategy game you will join the expedition of king's builders and architects on their noble quest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the story of true love and devotion while exploring, gathering resources, producing, trading, building, repairing and working for the well-being of your people! But, watch out! Greedy count Oli and his spies never sleep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/288610/extras/8fb48739271badd27a43f8b63eeda550.avif?t=1765537731\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Dozens of levels packed with city building fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 Build, upgrade, and defend your towns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Use powerful boosts &amp; unlock achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 Intriguing narrative — a plot with twists and memorable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ 3 difficulty levels – from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📴 Play completely offline — anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔒 No data collection — your privacy is safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click / Tap to gather resources, build houses, manage workers, and keep your people thriving as you progress through each level. Use boosts when things get tough — but the real reward is mastering strategy and efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand, optimize, upgrade, and develop your settlements the way you like. Customizable challenge — Relaxed, Standard, and Extreme difficulty modes. Earn Achievements as you complete objectives and perfect your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Immersive adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mix of colorful art, atmosphere, and story-rich progression paired with satisfying time-management and city-building mechanics. Whether you enjoy calm, casual resource gathering or intense strategic challenges — this game delivers both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/288610/extras/d2439b3ae4284f9f2eb110d4dd82f86e.avif?t=1765537731\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > HELP Finn and Dalla, the two young &quot;love-birds&quot; reunite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > MASTER the 40 EXCITING levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > MEET peculiar and funny characters along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > OUTSMART the greedy count Oli and his spies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > BUILD the prosperous kingdom for all of your subjects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > PLAY wheel of fortune</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 DIFFICULTY MODES: relaxed, timed and extreme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step-by-step TUTORIALS for beginners</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/288610/extras/e8a7a2b7ccd3349d97717cb15fa46196.avif?t=1765537731\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fun and colorful city builder - time management strategy game you will join the expedition of king's builders and architects on their noble quest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the story of true love and devotion while exploring, gathering resources, producing, trading, building, repairing and working for the well-being of your people! But, watch out! Greedy count Oli and his spies never sleep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/288610/extras/8fb48739271badd27a43f8b63eeda550.avif?t=1765537731\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Dozens of levels packed with city building fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 Build, upgrade, and defend your towns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Use powerful boosts &amp; unlock achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 Intriguing narrative — a plot with twists and memorable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ 3 difficulty levels – from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📴 Play completely offline — anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔒 No data collection — your privacy is safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click / Tap to gather resources, build houses, manage workers, and keep your people thriving as you progress through each level. Use boosts when things get tough — but the real reward is mastering strategy and efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand, optimize, upgrade, and develop your settlements the way you like. Customizable challenge — Relaxed, Standard, and Extreme difficulty modes. Earn Achievements as you complete objectives and perfect your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Immersive adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mix of colorful art, atmosphere, and story-rich progression paired with satisfying time-management and city-building mechanics. Whether you enjoy calm, casual resource gathering or intense strategic challenges — this game delivers both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/288610/extras/d2439b3ae4284f9f2eb110d4dd82f86e.avif?t=1765537731\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > HELP Finn and Dalla, the two young &quot;love-birds&quot; reunite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > MASTER the 40 EXCITING levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > MEET peculiar and funny characters along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > OUTSMART the greedy count Oli and his spies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > BUILD the prosperous kingdom for all of your subjects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > PLAY wheel of fortune</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 DIFFICULTY MODES: relaxed, timed and extreme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step-by-step TUTORIALS for beginners</p></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Enjoy the story of true love and devotion while exploring, gathering resources, producing, trading, building, repairing and working for the well-being of your people! But, watch out! Greedy count Oli and his spies never sleep!",
